                        "entry_id": "28383687-aa9f-394a-879a-2ed6200a5fc9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "юр. осуществлять опеку, то есть по решению суда охранять личные и имущественные права и интересы недееспособных граждан (малолетних, душевнобольных и т. п.), лишившихся попечения родственников и близких"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cf652d92-e277-374f-aa19-1113826f144d",
                        "entry_id": "28383687-aa9f-394a-879a-2ed6200a5fc9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "заботиться о ком-либо, помогать, оказывать поддержку кому-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "99ce2de5-ad5e-3f0e-9b9f-b1762308ddf4",
                        "entry_id": "28383687-aa9f-394a-879a-2ed6200a5fc9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "спорт. в командных спортивных играх — противодействовать конкретному игроку команды соперника, пытаясь ограничить его действия"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2a1cba57-60d6-4890-b992-eebe34316fca",
                        "source_entry_id": "28383687-aa9f-394a-879a-2ed6200a5fc9",
                        "source_sense_description": "осуществлять опеку",
                        "target_lang_word": "be guardian",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "327de49a-ad6f-48fd-8ab4-eb6c5f6f594c",
                        "source_entry_id": "28383687-aa9f-394a-879a-2ed6200a5fc9",
                        "source_sense_description": "заботиться, помогать, оказывать поддержку",
                        "target_lang_word": "look after",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "look after",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2ee69005-e52c-3415-9f16-4e98532f7f53",
                                        "entry_id": "a64743c3-fac3-3e36-97b6-2e658fbea594",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To follow with the eyes; to look in the direction of (someone or something departing)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4299bd8d-00ec-4b30-b7fc-c5b3be0a52bb",
                                                "sense_id": "2ee69005-e52c-3415-9f16-4e98532f7f53",
                                                "text": "The marshes were just a long black horizontal line then, as I stopped to look after him; and the river was just another horizontal line, not nearly so broad nor yet so black; and the sky was just a row of long angry red lines and dense black lines intermixed."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "82bde05a-4288-3c19-9efe-6729004a0509",
                                        "entry_id": "a64743c3-fac3-3e36-97b6-2e658fbea594",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To seek out, to look for."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "regional",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "56528387-3e3e-4075-8581-2e499e44839f",
                                                "sense_id": "82bde05a-4288-3c19-9efe-6729004a0509",
                                                "text": "My subject does not necessarily oblige me to look after this water, or point forth the place whereunto 'tis now retreated."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3090f346-3ee4-4a16-9b07-0c724be8d479",
                                                "sense_id": "82bde05a-4288-3c19-9efe-6729004a0509",
                                                "text": "I have sent my intended husband to look after my lover […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d41491a-91e6-4389-8238-442cc7c8f780",
                                                "sense_id": "82bde05a-4288-3c19-9efe-6729004a0509",
                                                "text": "If they are not married, they should be looking after a wife."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cadbe4b5-6156-41e3-b2b4-1550430500bc",
                                                "sense_id": "82bde05a-4288-3c19-9efe-6729004a0509",
                                                "text": "Sliding through the world: that is how, in a bygone age, they used to designate lives like his: looking after his interests, quietly prospering, attracting no attention."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9385f8c4-d86e-35e4-85ab-4ebb03d5c722",
                                        "entry_id": "a64743c3-fac3-3e36-97b6-2e658fbea594",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To care for; to keep safe."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "also",
                                            "reflexive",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a685cc8c-1365-4211-b847-8bea3d71e023",
                                                "sense_id": "9385f8c4-d86e-35e4-85ab-4ebb03d5c722",
                                                "text": "He asked me to look after his daughter while he was away."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f3cbf18-a8ff-46ed-baf2-e12c9c59b456",
                                                "sense_id": "9385f8c4-d86e-35e4-85ab-4ebb03d5c722",
                                                "text": "The station is clearly well looked after, making it a worthy gateway to the resort."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d6d54b7-8c50-4635-8898-2d32d72fea5a",
                                                "sense_id": "9385f8c4-d86e-35e4-85ab-4ebb03d5c722",
                                                "text": "\"And I thought: if muggins here, a 37-year-old government minister who can look after myself, feels that way, then we need to really think about how we're putting in place a level of protection for women."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d5b7dcb0-1ffe-36ca-b48f-df86cf817203",
                                        "entry_id": "a64743c3-fac3-3e36-97b6-2e658fbea594",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To have as one's business; to manage, be responsible for."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "85370769-55d0-3263-ac15-73fd837a1491",
                                        "entry_id": "a64743c3-fac3-3e36-97b6-2e658fbea594",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To expect, look forward to."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a4008654-eb65-4c3e-914d-f432d1516826",
                                                "sense_id": "85370769-55d0-3263-ac15-73fd837a1491",
                                                "text": "Mens hearts failing them for feare, and for looking after those things which are comming on the earth; For the powers of heauen shall be shaken."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
